The hardware consists of:
- an arduino uno
- a 1602 lcd with 6 buttons
- a hc-sr 04 ultrasonic sensor
- a dht temp / humid sensor
- a soild humidity sensor (with analog output)
- a stepper motor to open / close a valve driven by a uln driver (IN1, IN2, IN3, IN4)
- a relay for a water - pump on/off

| Component | Signal | Uno pin |
|---|---|---|
| HC-SR04 | TRIG | D2 |
| HC-SR04 | ECHO | D12 |
| DHT sensor | DATA | A2 |
| Soil moisture sensor | AO | A1 |
| ULN stepper driver | IN1 | D3 |
| ULN stepper driver | IN2 | D11 |
| ULN stepper driver | IN3 | **A4** |
| ULN stepper driver | IN4 | **A5** |
| Relay module | IN | **A3** |
| LCD shield | RS / Enable | D8 / D9 |
| LCD shield | Data D4–D7 | D4–D7 |
| LCD shield | Buttons | A0 |
| LCD shield | Backlight | D10, reserved |

